{"channelId":"UCr0NidhxKeAA0W2_FsfgRzQ","row":["Save the Wild Ones",480,"HOW IT ALL BEGAN\n\nSave the Wild Ones began, when a passion for helping the planet and a dream of saving wildlife intertwined. Here we do not just believe everything we hear, but we are open to change, and acknowledge that evolution in all aspects help make ourselves and the world a better place. We believe in looking at every side to a problem, and taking what you can from everyone including our WILD FRIENDS; even if that means you don’t agree with them 100%. Everyone and everything has something positive to offer this world, you just have to be willing to search for the answers. \n\nSTAY WILD MY FRIENDS 🐺🦅🐋\n\nMISSION STATEMENT\nWe believe that every wild one needs to be saved. A focus on education, research, and conservation, Save the Wild Ones aims to help every human or animal that needs saving. The goal is to leave the world in better condition than when we found it, and by helping ourselves, we help the ones around us.","savethewildone@gmail.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr0NidhxKeAA0W2_FsfgRzQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr0NidhxKeAA0W2_FsfgRzQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:53.559Z","channelId":"UCr0NidhxKeAA0W2_FsfgRzQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b19b98d849d78f45f734751f4be67125cd76564cf81540c5c0764b9ff43e4826","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"589f626374cd8e81701e13690785baee11cb47abcc58254e6df0f934d580d007"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr0NidhxKeAA0W2_FsfgRzQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:53.559Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr0NidhxKeAA0W2_FsfgRzQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":480,"raw":"480 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr0NidhxKeAA0W2_FsfgRzQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:53.559Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"savethewildone